PUBLIC SERVICES COMMITTEE
MINUTES
Due to the Martin Luther King Jr. Holiday, a meeting of the Public Services Committee was instead
held on Tuesday, January 21, 2025, in Committee Room
104 and via electronic meeting. starting
at 12:00 p.m. Those in attendance were as follow’s:
COMMITTEE MEMBERS: Tom Segrave, Chaimman; Dr. Michelle Aldrich; and Jeff White (via
Zoom). Absent: Dr. Kathy Emmons.
-:
.::.rt’,::r
