AGENDA ITEMS
15.
RESOLUTION
— Authorizing the Mayor and the City Clerk to sign a Final Plat for
Ilolliday Park, City of Cheyenne, Laramie County, Wyoming (located northeast of the
intersection of East Lincolnway and Morrie Avenue). (SPONSOR - MR. SEGRAVE)
Dr. Aldrich moved to adopt, seconded by Mr. White. Motion carried by unanimous voice vote.
Connor White, Planning & Development Department, provided a staff report and Brandon Swain,
developer, thanked City staff and was available for questions. Committee members Aldrich and
White commented on the item.
There being no further items for the agenda to come before the Public Services Committee, the
meeting was adjourned at 12:04 p.m.
Submitted by,
jennifer McClelland
Executive Assistant to the Cheyenne City Council
```
